            "meaning": "轿车"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "Jasper has put up 'No Parking' signs outside his gate, but these have not had any effect.",
      "translation": "贾斯珀在大门外挂上了'禁止停车'的牌子，但这没有任何效果。",
